WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Saved Section 19 assistant. The sidebar names local Llama 3.1 and Multilingual-E5.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Question: “What problems arise from a lack of airtightness?”

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The interface says: “Analyzing Regulation…”

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Answer: Air enters the building (infiltration) or leaves it (exfiltration). The response also mentions indoor-air quality, energy use and occupants’ health.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:47.000
The source-document panel opens. Source 1 is labelled “Page 91.” The extracted Persian text is visibly fragmented.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:58.000
The recording opens Mabhas19.pdf, the source PDF used by the retrieval prototype.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Viewer page 91, printed page 72: “Airtightness and air leakage.” Inadequate airtightness loses conditioned air and raises energy use.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Back in the source panel: Source 1 is page 91; a later visible source is page 50.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Second question: “Who was Michael Jackson?”

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:30.447
The prototype replies: “Information not found in context.”
